## Basic Project Commands

<List the commands for both sides. If your monorepo has a task runner
(Turborepo / Nx / pnpm / cargo / dotnet), list the aggregated commands
first, then the per-package ones.>

```bash
# Aggregate (run at repo root, if applicable):
<install>                                  # e.g. pnpm install, npm ci
<build all>                                # e.g. pnpm -r build, turbo run build
<test all>                                 # e.g. pnpm -r test, turbo run test
<lint all>                                 # e.g. pnpm -r lint, turbo run lint

# Frontend only:
<install>                                  # if FE has its own install step
<dev>                                      # e.g. npm run dev
<build>                                    # e.g. npm run build
<test>                                     # e.g. npm run test
<lint>                                     # e.g. npm run lint:check

# Backend only:
<restore>                                  # e.g. dotnet restore, mvn install
<build>                                    # e.g. dotnet build -c Release
<test>                                     # e.g. dotnet test
<migration>                                # only when a schema change is confirmed
```

